---
import ThemedArtwork from "@greenways-ai/visual-language/ThemedArtwork.astro";
---
<section class="historian-hero">
  <ThemedArtwork class="historian-hero__art" light="/images/historian-raven-day.webp" dark="/images/historian-raven-night.webp" lightAlt="A raven gathering code-history fragments and returning them to a sunlit indexed archive" darkAlt="The same raven watching the archive while lineage paths and indexed niches glow at night" position="center" />
  <div class="historian-hero__veil"></div>
  <div class="historian-hero__copy">
    <p class="technical-kicker"><i></i> Open foundation · Apache-2.0</p>
    <h1>Code remembers.</h1>
    <p>Historian walks a repository’s commit DAG, analyzes changed blobs once, tracks symbol lineage, and stores deterministic retrieval documents in SQLite. Git remains the source of truth.</p>
    <div class="hero-links"><a class="action action--raven" href="/getting-started/">Start indexing →</a><a class="action" href="/concepts/temporal-index/">How it works</a><a class="action" href="https://github.com/greenways-ai/historian">Source ↗</a></div>
    <div class="hero-command"><code>npm install -g @greenways-ai/historian</code><span>Bun · SQLite · Git</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
